  "goodToKnow": "Die Entbindung is the delivery of a baby: die Entbindung im Krankenhaus, die Hausgeburt. In Germany every woman has a right to a Hebamme (midwife), and Mutterschutz gives eight weeks off after the birth. Entbinden also means to release from an obligation: von der Schweigepflicht entbinden. Plural: die Entbindungen."
